<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">Ndamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 VAKOLINDU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa ya kwaa ya Pauli kwa Vakolindu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vakolindu</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Vkl</para>
  <para style="mt2">BALUWA YA KWAA YA PAULI KWA VANDU VA KOLINDU</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 VAKOLINDU</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULELU</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha kwaa kwa Vakolindu chayandikiwili na ndundami Pauli kucha myaka milongu muhanu na muhanu naha yipitili kukandila pawonikili Yesu. sula ya 1:1</para>
  <para style="ip">Ayi ndi baluwa yaki ya kwaa gati ya baluwa shaki mbili situvelili nashu sheni Pauli avayandikilili lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu va aku Kolindu. Pamongapa ayandikili baluwa ayi chipindi paghaveyi akwikala aku Ifesu chipindi akali hela kulamula kutyangila Kolindu mumwanja waki wa kuyenda na kuwuya Mekedoniya sula ya 16:5-9.</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa ayi ndi nyangulilu ya milandu yayipokilili Pauli kufuma kwa vandu vamu va lipinga lya vandu yivamjumila Kilistu kwilata figoli fya wafu gati ya veni figoli fyeni pamu na kwibava na uwoni. Mbwani ya Kolindu yamanyikili munu kwa uwoni waki topi yikukang'anikiwa ha kulola kucha na hata lipinga lya yivamjumilili Kilistu va aku lyatakwili na milandu ayi. Vakolindu va kwaa wuwula wula yiva na sula yimanyikili yiilata utami sula ya 13</para>
  <para style="iot">Fivelili amu kwa chikata,</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli akuvajambusha Vakolindu na akumulumba Chapanga kwanongwa ya veni sula ya 1:1-9.</para>
  <para style="io">Kandi akuhimulila lulayilayi kwilata kwitapula kwa lipinga lya yivajumilili va Kolindu sula ya 1:10-4:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambeli akuhimulila kwilata milandu ya uwoni na kwiyegha veni kwa veni muchitemela sula ya 5-6.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambeli akulayilila kwilata ndambu ya kwiheta na kutawula mitambiku kwa ming'omung'omu na ndambu ya kudadava na fupu sha chindima pamu na ushukushu sula ya 7-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Kamalilila na ndambu sha ngalilu ya figoli na milandu yimwilata mundu yumu yumu sula ya 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nenga Pauli ngemiwa kuva ndundami wa Yesu Kilistu ngimu wadayilili Chapanga na mlongu Sositeni, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tukuvayandikila yumwi yimuvelili munyumba ya Chapanga aku Kolindu. Yumwi yimugolikili vang'alili mukwilumba na Yesu Kilistu, mukemiwa muvi vandu va Chapanga, pamu na vandu vosi na kosi kuvamudadava Bambu wetu Yesu Kilistu yavelili Bambu wenu na yufwi wuwowu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nguvaluvila usangi na kusika kufuma kwa Chapanga mweni ndi Tati wetu na Bambu wetu Yesu Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga katunemela kupitila Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ngumulumba Chapanga wangu majuva vosi kwanongwa ya yumwi kwa usangi yavapili kwa deha ya Yesu Kilistu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nongwa kwa kwilumba na Kilistu musangiliwa findu fyosi. Mugayiliwa umanyi wosi na uwesu wosi wa kuwomba. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nongwa utovileli wetu kwa Yesu Kilistu uwonikili mugati ya yumwi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Topi damuyangishiwi ha nemusi shoshonda sha chindima, pamuva mukumvetela kugubutuliwa kwa mweni Bambu wetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mweni davaviki ng'we mbaka mwishu, mkotoki kuwoneka na sambi mulijuva lila lya Bambu wetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Chapanga ndi yagola jangi shaki, yavakemili mwilumbi na mwanamundu Yesu Kilistu Bambu wetu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuyitapula mugati ya lipinga limjumilili Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Valongu vangu vadala na valumi Nguvayilapila kwa litawa lya Bambu wetu Yesu Kilistu, kucha vosi tuvi na detelu yimu, mukotoo kulekanila mugati yenu muvi na natilu yimu na hoshu yimu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Valongu vangu mbikana kufuma kwa vandu va nyumba ya Chiloyi, kucha kuna ndilingu mugati ya yumwi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngudeta afi, Vamonga vakudeta, “Nenga wa Pauli”. Vamonga vakudetaa, “Nenga wa Apolu” Vamonga vakudeta, “Nenga wa Kefa” Na vamonga, “Nenga wa Kilistu.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wuli, Kilistu mweni kalekanila? Wuli, Pauli ndi yavangililwili mulupingika kwanongwa ya yumwi? Awu mwabatishiwili kwa litawa lya Pauli? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ngumulumba Chapanga kucha ndimubatisha ng'odu hata yumu gati ya yumwi, ila Kilispu na Gayu hela, <verse number="15" style="v"/>kwa hela mundu daweshi kudeta kabatishiwa kwa litawa lya nenga. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yina, ndivabatisha vandu va nyumba ya Stefwani, nguyihola kucha ndimubatisha ha mundu wingi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwanongwa Kilistu kanayisha kubatisha ha, kanyegha ndivalandulili milandu ya nyanyi, ngajila maywangu va luhunja lwa mundu, ili liwovi lya kusova kwa Kilistu palupingika likotoo kuyaghamila.</para>
  <para style="s">Kilistu ndi liwovi na luhunja lwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nongwa unjagila wa kusova kwa Kilistu mulupingika chindu ng'odu kwa vala yivayaghamilili, lakini kwa yufwi tuveli mudeha ya ulowolu, ndi liwovi lya Chapanga. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mayandiku vakudeta,</para>
  <para style="q">“Danyanangi luhunja lwa vanaluhunja,</para>
  <para style="q">yivaveli na luhala lwa kusoma dandivadangili kutali.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vakoti vana luhala? Vakoti, vawula va Malawu? Vakoti yivawesha kulimbana muchipindi achi? Chapanga kagola luhunja lwa mlima awu kuva upufi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwa luhunja lwaki Chapanga kavagola vandu vakotoo kumumanya kupitila luhunja lwawu veni, lakini kupitila chila chivachikema, “Unjagila wa pufi” Wula wutulandula, Chapanga akudayila kuvalowola vala yivajumilili. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vayawudi vakudayila mihilu valoli vajumili, Vagiliki vakudayila luhunja, <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lakini yufwi tumlandula Kilistu yavangiliwili mulupingika, kwa Vayawudi achi ndi chindu chikuvagola vayikwali, kwa vangajila kuva Vayawudi ndi usiyisiyi, <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lakini kwa veni yivakemiliwi na Chapanga payiva Vayawudi awu Vagiliki, Kilistu ndi liwovi lya Chapanga na luhunja lwa Chapanga. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwa fila fikuwoneka ndi usiyisiyi wa Chapanga fiva na luhunja pitu kwa luhunja lwa mundu, nongwa chila chiwoneka kucha usosuvafu wa Chapanga, china liwovi pitu liwovi lya mundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Valongu muyiholi chipindi Chapanga pavakemili, ngimu ya umanyi wa vandu vayenu vatangalili vaveli ha na luhunja, vatangalili ha vaveli vandu va ukomi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lakini Chapanga kashawula findu fisisii avagayili soni vaveli na luhunja, Kandi Chapanga kashawula findu fingajila liwovi afigayili soni fila fiveli na liwovi, <verse number="28" style="v"/>Chapanga kafishawula findu fya pasi na fila findu fibedaliwa, kashawula milandu yivelili ng'odu, kwanongwa ayi adayilili kufiyananga fila vandu fivayihola fya mana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwanongwa ayi kwahela mundu dayidumbi chindu kwa Chapanga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Chapanga ndi atulumbili yufwi na Yesu Kilistu na Chapanga kamugola Kilistu kuva luhunja kufuma kwa Chapanga. na ayi ndi ugoleki, ung'alili na ukombola. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kucha Mayandiku Vang'alili pavawomba,</para>
  <para style="q">“Yadayila kuyijuma,</para>
  <para style="q">Topi na ayijumili chichuku cha Bambu.”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chilongu cha Kilistu yavangiliwili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Valongu vangu panyisili kwa yumwi kuvalandulila mbwepu ya Chapanga, gola ha kwa filongu fya chiganu na luhunja. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pameli kwa yumwi na mulili ndiyisemwi kila chindu, ila Yesu Kilistu mweni yavangiliwili mulupingika. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Panyisili kwa yumwi ndaveli msosuvafu ndaveli ngubagama na lyogha nendu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Unjagila wangu na kulandula kwaveli kwa kuvang'ang'anika ha vandu vajumili muhala shawu, ila kwa uwoneku wa liwovi lya Mfuki. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gola naha ili ujumilwa wenu ukotoo kuva muluhunja lwa vandu, ila muliwovi lya Chapanga. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lakini kulandula chilongu cha luhunja kwa vala yivajumila. Lakini luhunja lwa mlima ha, awu luhunja lwa wovi sitavala chipindi achi siyangiliwa wovi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Luhunja lutuywangila ndi lula lwafisili Chapanga, lweni alushawulili chipindi mlima ukali kugoliwa kwanongwa ya ukomi wetu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwahela vatwa va mlima awu yivamanyili luhunja alu. Leki vangamanyili vangamvangililili mulupingika ha Bambu wa ukomi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kucha mayandiku vang'alili pavawomba naha, “kwahela mesu valolili, kwa hela lijeji lipikanili findu fila mundu akalihela kwihola mundima, afi ndi Chapanga fyavatandilili vala yivamtama.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nongwa Chapanga katugubutulila kupitila Mfuki Mng'alili, nongwa Mng'alili akulolesha findu fyosi hata fiyifisili mugati ya Chapanga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mfuki wa mundu weka akumanya milandu ya ndima ya mundu, wuwula Mfuki wa Chapanga kamanya fyosi fya Chapanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini yufwi tuyanga ha mfuki wa mlima, ila Mfuki Mg'alili yafumili kwa Chapanga, tuweshi kumanya fyosi fyatugayilili Chapanga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi tukuwomba ha kwa filongu fyavawomba muluhunja lwa mundu, lakini kwa filongu fiwuliwa na Mfuki patuvamanya maywangu vaki. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mundu wa mumlima daweshi ng'odu kuyanga fupu yila yifuma kwa Mfuki wa Chapanga vandu ava kavamanya ha, wuva usiyisiyi kwa veni davahighiwi kucha ndima wuyimanya mugati. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mweni yaveli na ndima, kamanya fyosi kwa hela mundu wa kumuhigha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kucha mayandiku pavawomba, ghani yamanyili chadayila Bambu? Mweni damuwombeli? Twenga tuva na chila chadayila Kilistu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yivamkimbanikila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Valongu vangu, nenga ng'omba ha na yumwi kucha vandu yimuvelili na Mfuki, lakini, ng'omba na yumwi kucha vandu va mlima, kucha vana fyali, mugati ya Kilistu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ndavalandishili majiva, ndivapa ha filivi fikamalili, kwanongwa mwaweshili ng'odu. Kandi mbaka ponopa mukali hela kuwesha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nongwa mukali mukuyikala ngalilu ya mvili. Muva na weyi na mukuyileva, yumwi muva kucha vandu va mvili, ngalilu yenu kucha vandu va mlimawu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Topi yumu pakawomba, “Ngumkovekela Pauli” Na wingi “Ngumkovekela Apolu”. Yumwi mukugola kucha vandu va mlima. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Panu Apolu kava ghani? Na Pauli kava ghani? Ava vosi vatangi va Chapanga, kupitila ava yumwi vosi damumjumili Chapanga. Vosi ava vakugola chichuku chila Tati avagayilili vagoli. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nenga sila mbeyu, Apolu amwayilili machi muhali, lakini Chapanga agolili ukali. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yula yasilila mbeyu na yula yamwayilila ava vosi chindu ha ila Chapanga yagola muhali wukuli. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yasilili na yamwayilili machi vosi valinganila hela kila mundu dapati fupu kwa chichuku chaki chagolili. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yufwi vagola chichuku pamu muchitava cha Chapanga. Yumwi muva chitava cha Chapanga na nyumba yigoliwa ya Chapanga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kucha unyangili usangi wa Chapanga, nenga kucha mgola nyumba yaveli na luhunja, ngugola chikandilu na wingi akugola pambindi yaki. Topi kila mundu aloli ndambu wayendelela kugola. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yawesha kuvika chikandilu chingi, badili ya chila chikandilu chivikiwili kala, achi ndi Yesu Kilistu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mundu akuwesha kukimika pachikandilu achi, kwa kugolela chumang'andu na madini va mbiya na migonguveli yitaukili na mibiki na mihamba na midasi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>chichuku cha kila mundu dayilingiwi, unofu wa chichuku dauwoneki lijuva lila, motu dawufumbushi chichuku cha kila mundu, motu dawulangushi nakaka unofu wa chichuku cha kila mundu chagolili. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Leki chichuku cha mundu yoyosi payisighala pachikandilu, ayu dapati fupu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Leki chichuku cha mundu pachilungula, ayu dapati ha fwayida hata leki mweni dalowuliwi kucha wula kasipuka mumotu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nakaka yumwi mumanya ng'odu kucha muva nyumba ya Chapanga na Mfuki Mng'alili akwikala mugati yenu?. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mundu yabowola nyumba ya Chapanga, Chapanga damuyanangi mundu ayu. Nongwa nyumba ya Chapanga ying'ala, nyumba ayi ndi yumwi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mukotoo kwipughanya mwaveni. Mundu gati ya yumwi, akwihola mweni kana luhala mumlima awu, ghavi mpufi ili aweshi kuva na luhala. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nongwa luhunja lwa mlima awu, wuva upufi pawulongulu ya Chapanga. Nongwa yiyandikiwa kucha, yivavelili na luhunja vakamuliwa muusugu wawu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kandi Bambu akumanya hoshu sha vanaluhunja siva chindu ha. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Topi mundu akotoo kwidumbila vandu. Nongwa kila chindu chiva cha yumwi, <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ghavi Pauli awu Apolu na Kefa, mlima awu, unofu na njifwa, yifivelili panopawu na pawulongolu, fyosi fya yumwi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lakini yumwi muva va Kilistu na Kilistu kava wa Chapanga.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Vakolintu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Topi, mumanyi kucha yufwi tuva vandumindumi va Kilistu, tuva vatovilela va mbwepu ya nakaka ya Chapanga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yichidayiliwa kwa ndumindumi yoyosi awoneki goleki kwa Chapanga. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwa nenga chindu ha, pahighiwa na yumwi awu chitemela cha uwundu, hata kuhighiwa na munda yangu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ndima yangu yikuhighiwa na chindu ng'odu, lakini ayi yikulangusha ha kucha nenga ndiva hela livifyu. Bambu ndi yahigha nenga. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Topi mukotoo kuhigha chindu chochosi mbaka chipindi cha Bambu pachifika, mweni dafisuli findu fifisikili daafiyeghi pangesha na daafiviki fila fivelili mundima sha vandu. Pambeli Chapanga daamjumi kila mundu ngimu wadayiliwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Topi valongu vangu, filongu afi figolili ili fivi chilangushilu cha nenga na Apolu kwanongwa yenu ili muuweshi kwiwula mana ya detelu ayi, mukombikeshi fila fiyandikiwili, gati yenu akotoo kuwoneka mundu yayijuma mweni na kuvabedala vamonga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ghani yakugolili wuvi wa paweka kwa vandu?. Kuna chindu liki chiwuvelili kupokela ng'odu? Leki wapatili kala ponopa yiva wuliwuli ukwifuna kwa chindu chiwupatili kala?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ponopa mufipata kala fyosi! Muva kala valundamali! Muva vatwa pangajila yufwi, Ngudayila muvi vatwa, ili na yufwi tuvi Vatwa wuwowu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nenga ngwihola kucha Chapanga katugola yufwi tuvi vandundami, kucha vandu yivahighiwili njifwa, nongwa tuva chiloja pawulongolu ya mlima wonda na pawulongolu ya makungu na vandu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yufwi tuvapufi kwanongwa ya Kilistu, lakini yumwi muva na luhala kwa kwilumba na Kilistu! Yufwi twavasosuvafu lakini yumwi muna liwovi, yumwi mukutundamiliwa lakini yufwi tukubedaliwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mbaka ponopa tuva na njala na kuyumilwa machi na tuvahela yingwa, tukutovangiwa munu na tuvahela pakuwonja. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yufwi tukughayanika kugola chichuku kwa mawoku vetu twaveni. Pavatulapila yufwi tukuvanemela, pavatutesha yufwi tukwiwunishila, <verse number="13" style="v"/>pavatujowola yufwi tukuvayangula kwa kutundamila. Mbaka panopawu yufwi tukuwoneka kucha findu fya pachifungusi na kwa kila mundu tukuwoneka vembukoti!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nguyandika ha milandu ayi nongwa ya kuvataya chindipa yumwi, ila kuvakayika kucha vana vangu yindivatamili. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hata pamuva na valeli vatangalili kwa kwilumba na Yesu Kilistu, muna tati wenu yumu hela. Kwanongwa kwa kwilumba na Kilistu nenga ndi tati wenu kwa kuvayeghela Chilongu cha Nyanyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nguvaluva muvi kucha nenga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ndi nongwa ndimulayisha Timotewu kwa yumwi. Mweni mwana wangu muujumilwa yindimtamili yangajila udesi kwa kwilumba na Bambu. Mweni davakumbushi deha yingombikesha mukwilumba na Yesu Kilistu. Nguvawula deha ayi kila mahali vandu yivamjumila Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vandu vamonga gati ya yumwi vakanda kwifuna kucha nyisi ha kwa yumwi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini Bambu padayila, danyisi kwa yumwi kalopu, topi dandiyiwoneli kwa mesu vangu, afi fivadeta weka ha ila na liwovi livavelili nalyu vandu ava yivayifuna. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nongwa muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuva mufilongu hela ha, ila muliwovi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Choti chimuchidayila? Nyisi kwa yumwi na muhumbati, awu nyisi na ndima ya utami na ushisha moyu?</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Uwoni munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ponopa yikudeteka kuna uwoni gatiya yumwi na uwoni awu wukalihela kuwoneka hata kwa vandu vangajila kumumanya Chapanga. Mundu akujova na mdala wa tati mundu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ponopa wuli damuweshi kwifuna yingaveli finofu yumwi mung'ong'utekikwa muwushiwi yula yagolili chindu achi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hata pandiva kutali na yumwi chimumvili, lakini ndima yangu yiva pamu na yumwi. Hata naha ndimuhigha kala mundu ayu yagolili chindu achi cha chindipa kucha ndiva bahapa na yumwi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pamutang'ana kwa litawa lya Bambu wetu Yesu Kilistu, nenga ndiva pamu na yumwi, chindima na liwovi lya Bambu wetu Yesu Kilistu yiva baha. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mumuhadishi mundu ayu kwa Lijangavandu ili mvili waki wudanganyishiwi na ndima yaki yiweshi kulowuliwa mulijuva lila Bambu payisa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nyanyi ha yumwi kwifuna, mumanya ng'odu kucha lindwesi limu hela lya simika likusasisha ukova wosi? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Muying'alishi na simika yadahili mukayiyasili kutali ili muvi lindwesi lya shonu lingajila kutayiwa simika kucha wuyidayiliwa kuva, nongwa, Kilistu, Lihungu lyetu, katawuliwa kala kuva litambiku. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Topi, tugoli lihungu ali kwa yila simika ya dahili ha, simika ya ubaya na wafu, ila kwa libumunda lingajila kutayiwa simika, libumunda livelili nyanyi na nakaka. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ndavayandikilili mubaluwa yangu kucha mukotoo kuva pamu na vawoni. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Topi ngudeta ha kucha vandu vangajila kumumanya Chapanga, vawoni, vabafu, vafyangu na vala yivatundamila ming'omung'omu. Ili kuvayilyepa vosi ava yingavagolili yumwi muhami mlimawu nakamu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Chinyandikili achi, mukotoo kuyihasha na Mkilistu yaveli muwoni, mwimi, yatundamila ming'omung'omu, yajongishela, njayila na munakupughanya vandu. Mundu kucha ayu mukotoo kulya pamu na mweni. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuvahigha vandu va panji achi chichuku cha nenga ha. Chapanga davahighi veni. Yumwi mkudayila ng'odu kuvahigha vala yivaveli gati ya yumwi?. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini ava vavelili panji ya Chapanga davahighi. Mumvingili kutali ayu mwafu.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyihigha kwa vandu vamjumilili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Daweshi wuli wuli mundu kumuhigha yajumilili pawulongolu ya chitemela cha vangajila kumjumila Chapanga leki naha ng'odu kumuhigha kwa vandu va Chapanga? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mumanya ng'odu kucha vang'alili va Chapanga davawuhighi mlima? Leki mlima pawuhighiwa na yumwi mukuwesha kuhigha hata kwa milandu midokwa? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wuli mumanya ng'odu kucha hata patuhigha milandu midokwa ya majuva vosi, datuvahighi hata makungu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pamuva na shoshu, mumilandu ya majuva vosi, wuli mukuvakema valamula muchitemela vandu vangajila kumumanya Chapanga? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chindipa weka kwa yumwi! Yikuwesha kuva kwahela hata mundu yumu yaveli na luhunja lwa kuhigha milandu ya vandu yivamjumilili Chapanga? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pambeli yiva chishovi mundu yamluva Chapanga akumuhigha mlongumundu kuchitemela cha vangajila kumumanya Chapanga vamuhighi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nakaka kuyihigha mwaveni kukulangusha kucha mulemwa nakaka. Yingaveli finofu kwa yumwi kuvifyiwa? Yingaveli finofu ng'odu kwa yumwi kupokiwa mali shyenu? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini yumwi yimugola wafu na ujangi na upoki, kandi afi mkuvagolela valongu venu! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wuli, mumanya ng'odu kucha vandu va wafu davahali ha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga? Mkotoo kuyijanga! Vandu yivayikala muuwoni, yivatundamila ming'omung'omu, uwoni awu yivayifika valumi kwa valumi, <verse number="10" style="v"/>vefi na vabafu na vanjayila na vahesi na vapoki, ava vosi davayihashi ha muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Gati ya yumwi ndamuva naha, lakini ponopa muwushiwa sambi shenu, mugoliwa vang'alili, muva goleki na Chapanga kwa litawa lya Bambu Yesu Kilistu na Mfuki wa Chapanga wetu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mundu akuwesha kudeta, “Kwa nenga nguwesha kugola chindu chochosi.” Lakini findu fyosi fya nyanyi ha. Ngujumila kucha findu fyosi fya nyanyi kwa nenga lakini dayila ha chindu chochosi chidopileli.</para>
  <para style="s">Njimba shenu sivi kwa ukomi wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mundu wingi akuwesha kudeta, “Chilivi kwanongwa ya mtima na mtima kwanongwa ya filivi.” Yina, lakini Chapanga dafiyanangi fivili fyosi. Mvili wa mundu wuva kwanongwa ya kuyiwonjeka ha, wuva kwanongwa ya kumkimbanikila Bambu, na mweni Chapanga akuukimbanikila mvili.</para>
  <para style="s">Njimba shenu sivi kwa ukomi wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwa liwovi lyaki, Chapanga amshukushili Bambu Yesu munjifwa datushukushi na yufwi wuwula wula kwa liwovi lyaki. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mumanya ng'odu kucha mivili yenu fisingu fya mvili wa Kilistu? Mukuyihola kucha dangweshi kutola mvili wa Kilistu na kugola mvili wa muwoni? Ng'odu! <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kucha wumumanyili yaihasha na muwoni akuva mvili wumu na mweni ngimu wuyiyandikiwili mumayandiku Vang'alilli, “Vavili davavi mvili wumu.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lakini yayilumbili na Bambu akuva yumu na mweni chindima. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Muyiseyi nendu na uwoni. Kwanongwa sambi simonga shonda sigobola ha mvili, lakini muwoni akugola sambi kwa kugobola mvili waki mweni. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mumanya ng'odu kucha njimba shenu siva nyumba sha Chapanga sha Mfuki Mng'alili yaveli mgati ya yumwi, mweni mwamyangili kufuma kwa Chapanga? Topi, yumwi wa Chapanga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Avahemilili kwa mbiya sitawukili, topi mivili yenu muyigoli kwanongwa ya kumjuma Chapanga.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Milandu ya kuheta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kwanongwa ya milandu yila yimuyandikilili, kucha, nyanyi mundu paheta ng'odu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lakini kwanongwa kuna uwoni munu, kila mlumi ghavi na mwehi waki mweni na kila mdala ghavi na mlumi waki mweni. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mlumi amugoleli mwehi mundu kucha wuyilatili na mwehi amugoleli mlumi mundu ngimu wuyivelili natilu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mvili wa mwehi waki mweni ha ila wa bambu mundu na mvili wa mlumi waki mweni ha ila wa mwehi mundu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mkotoo kwikaja, ila chipindi chidokwa hela pamulamula mwaveni, nongwa mpati fwasi ya kudadava kwa Chapanga. Pambeli mwiwuyilili kandi, ili Lijangavandu akotoo kuvayesha kwanongwa damuweshi ha kuyiwunishila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Afi ngufideta nenga hela vakudeta Malawu ha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngadayilili vandu vosi vavi kucha nenga wumelili, lakini kila mundu kagayiliwa fupu yaki yaweka kufuma kwa Chapanga, yumu kana fupu ayi na wingi kana yila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ponopa vala yivavelili vaigani vala vangalimlyangu nguvafunda vakotoo kuheta awu kutoliwa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Leki, mundu daweshi ng'odu kwiwunishila, topi aheti awu ahetiwi, nongwa ngiba kuheta awu kuhetiwa pitu kuva na dobukelu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwa vala yivayihetili ndina amuli, amuli yeni ya nenga ha, ila ya Bambu, mwehi akotoo kulekana na bambu mundu, <verse number="11" style="v"/>lakini palekana na bambu mundu akotoo kuhetiwa, awu vajovanishiwi kandi na bambu mundu. Mlumi akotoo kumleka mwehi mundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwa vamonga nguvawombela naha, ngudeta ndimweni Bambu ha, leki kuna mlumi Mkilistu kana mdala yangajila kumjumila Kilistu na ayu mdala kajumila kuyendilela kuyikala nayu akotoo kumleka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Leki kuna mdadala Mkilistu kana mlumi yangajila kumjumila Kilistu na ayu mlumi kajumila kwikala nayu akotoo kumleka bambu mundu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nongwa kwa yula mlumi yangajila kumjumila Chapanga, akujumiliwa na Chapanga kwa kwilumba na mdala mundu na kwa yula mdala yangajila kumjumila Chapanga na mweni akuyangiwa kwa Chapanga kwa kwilumba na mlumi mundu. Pamongapa ngajila naha vana vawu vangaveli vana va Chapanga ha, topi ponopa vajumiliwa kuva vana va Chapanga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hata naha kwa yula yangajila kumjumila Chapanga padayila kumleka muyaki yaveli Mkilistu, topi amleki hela. Topi yula Mkilistu, mdala awu mlumi daghavi pekesu. Nongwa Chapanga katukema yufwi twikali kwa kusika. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yuwi mdadala Mkilistu dawumanyi wuliwuli kucha dawuweshi kumkombola mlumi waku? Awu yuwi mlumi Mkilistu dawuwesha wuliwuli kumanya kucha dawuweshi kumlowola mdala waku?</para>
  <para style="s">Wikali ngimu wukemiwili na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi, kila mundu ayikali kwa ndambu Bambu wamugayilili fupu, ayikali ngimu wakemiliwi na Chapanga. Ali ndi lilaghililu lyangu kwa vandu vosi yivamjumilili Chapanga. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Leki mundu akemiwili adumuliwili kala jandu, topi akotoo kwilyambishila kadumula ng'odu jandu na pakemiwili aveli akali hela kudumula jandu, topi akotoo kudumula jandu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nongwa kwingila jandu awu kwingila ng'odu jandu chindu ha, chitawukili kukamula Malawu va Chapanga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Topi, kila mundu asighali wuwula wula ngimu chipindi Chapanga wamkemili. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wuli, yuwi wavelili mvanda pakukemeyi Chapanga? Topi, kotoo kwipwelesha, lakini pawuwesha kuva pekesu, ugoli nahawu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwa yula yakemiwili na Chapanga paghaveyi mvanda mundu ayu akulowuliwa na Bambu. Wuwula wula yula yakemilwi paghaveyi pekesu mundu ayu akuva mvanda wa Kilistu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Chapanga kavahemela kwa ndambu yitalamili, topi mukotoo kuva kandi vavanda va vandu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Valongu vangu kila mundu ayikali na ngimu wumwilumbili na Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Milandu ya vachengu na vangalimlyangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ponopa vala vayenji na vachengu, ndivahela lilawu kufuma kwa Bambu, lakini ngufideta afi kucha mundu yijumiliwili ngimu wuluvelili lusungu lwa Bambu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kwanongwa ya tabu sivelili ponopa, nyanyi yumwi mwikali ngimu wumuvelili. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wuli, kuheta kala? Ukotoo kulekana na mdala waku. Wuli, ukali hela kuheta? Topi, ukotoo kuheta. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lakini leki pawuheta mdala ukuvifya ha, leki kamwali pahetiwa akuvifya ha. Ava yivayihetili davapati msayisayi wa mlima awu, lakini nenga dayila ha afi fivafiki yumwi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Valongu ngudayila kudeta naha, chipindi chisighalili chidokwa, kufuma ponopa vala yivahetili vayikali kucha wula vaheta ha, <verse number="30" style="v"/>na vala yivalila vavi kucha vakulila ha na vala yivasekilela vavi kucha vakusekilela ha na vanakuhemela vavi kucha vahela chindu, <verse number="31" style="v"/>na vala yivakimbanikila mlima awu vavi kucha vakukimbanikila ha. Nongwa kucha wutumanyili mlima awu ngimu wuuvelili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ngudayila mukotoo kwipwelesha. Mundu yangajila kuheta akwihola munu chichuku cha Bambu ili amunoweshi Bambu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mlulumi yahetili akwihola munu findu fya mlima ili kumunowesha mwehi mundu, <verse number="34" style="v"/>wuwowu na mweni kavaghanika. Mdadala yangajila kuhetiwa awu muyenji mweni akukimbanikila milandu ya Bambu, ili ghavi mng'alili wa mvili na ndima. Lakini mdadala yahetiwili akukimbanikila na milandu ya mlima awu, ili amunoweshi bambu mundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ngudeta afi nongwa ngudayila kuvatanga yumwi, nguvapoka upekesu ha. Lakini ngudayila yumwi mugoli findu fya usangi na mwitangi mwaveni muchilongu cha Bambu ngajila kuvang'ang'anika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Leki mundu pawona akumugolela uswanu ng'odu nondi waki, leki pawona mdadala ayu aweshi ng'odu kuhetiwa na mlulumi wingi kwanongwa kagogola na leki akuwesha ng'odu kwikala ngajila kuheta agoli ngimu wadayila, pamuheta dagoli sambi ha. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lakini leki mlumi ayu palamula mweni mundima yaki kuleka kuheta na leki akuwesha kwiwunishila dobukelu shaki sha vakavali, topi akugola unofu kumleka kumuheta kamwali ayu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Topi, yula yalamula kuheta akugola unofu na yula yaleka kuheta akugola nyanyi nendu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mdala yahetiwili ayu kawopiwa na bambu mundu chipindi mlumi waki paghava mnofu. Lakini leki bambu mundu pasova, akuwesha kuhetiwa na mundu wingi ila mlumi ayu ghavi yamjumila Kilistu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lakini nenga nguwona, dayivi nyanyi mdadala ayu ayikali ngajila kuhetiwa na nenga wuwu ngwihola ndiva na Mfuki wa Chapanga.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Filivi fyavavatambikilili ming'omung'omu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ponopa milandu yiyilatili filivi fyavatambikilili ming'omung'omu, tumanya kucha twavosi yufwi tuva na umanyi, lakini umanyi awu wukuvagola vandu vamonga vayijumi, lakini utami wukugola. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mundu yayihola kucha kamanya chindu nakaka kamanya chindu ha kila chindu ngimu wuchimwilata kumanya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lakini kila mundu yamutama Chapanga, akumanyika na mweni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Topi kwa kulya filivi fitambikiliwi ming'omung'omu, tumanya kucha ming'omung'omu chindu ha mumlima, tumanya kucha kwahela vamlungu vengi ila ndi Chapanga weka yaki. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hata leki kuna vandu vakudeta kuna vamlungu mumlima awu kumbindi kwa Chapanga, hata kucha kuna vamlungu na vabambu vatangalili, <verse number="6" style="v"/>lakini kwa yufwi kuna Chapanga yumu hela. Tati yalumbili fyosi, kupitila mweni yufwi tugoleka. Kandi kwaveli Bambu yumu hela, ndi Yesu Kilistu, kupitila mweni findu fyosi figoleka na kupitila mweni yufwi tukuyikala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lakini kila mundu ha yamanyili unakaka awu. Nongwa kuna vandu yivashovililili kwijuma ming'omung'omu, mbaka nalelu pavalya filivi afi vakwihola filivi afi fitambikiliwa ming'omung'omu. Nongwa ndima shawu sosuvafu, vakwiwona vawafu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini filivi fikuwesha ha kutuyegha pabehi munu na Chapanga. Patufileka kulya tukuyangiliwa chindu ha, patulya tukuyongishiwa chindu ha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lakini muyivavali, upekesu wenu wa kugola findu wukotoo kuvagola vala yivavelili na ujumilwa mdokwa vawili mu sambi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nongwa mundu yaveli na ndima sosuvafu, pakuwona yuwi muna umanyi ukulya filivi afi mugati ya nyumba ya kudadavila ming'omung'omu, wuli, davakukuvilishi kulya filivi fyavatambikilili ming'omung'omu ng'odu? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Topi ayu mlongu waku msosuvafu wa ndima yavelili Kilistu asovili kwanongwa ya mweni, dayaghamili kwanongwa yumwi mukuukema umanyi wenu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kucha pamuvavifya valongu venu mukilistu ndambu ayi, kunu pavasitesha hoshu shawu sosuvafu na yumwi mukumuvifya Kilistu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi payiva filivi findilya fikumugola mkilistu muyangu agoli sambi, dandilyi nyama kandi ha, ngotoo kumugola mkilistu muyangu agoli vifyu.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fichuku fya Vandundami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Wuli, nenga mundu yimbekisukili ng'odu? Wuli nenga ndundami ng'odu? Wuli, nenga ndimuwona ng'odu Yesu Bambu wetu? Wuli, yumwi fivelekwa fya chichuku cha nenga ng'odu kwanongwa ya Bambu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hata leki vandu vamonga vakujumila ng'odu kucha nenga ndundami, lakini padokwa kwa yumwi nenga ndiva ndundami. Yumwi ndi utoveleli wa undundami wangu kwanongwa ya numbilu yenu kwa Bambu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nahawu ndi wundiyitasha kwa vala yivanimba, <verse number="4" style="v"/>wuli, nguwesha ng'odu kulya na kulanda kwa chichuku achi chigola? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wuli, tukujumishwa ng'odu kumtola mdala yamjumila Kilistu mumyanja yetu, kucha wuvagola vandundami vengi, Bambu na Kefa valongu vaki? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Awu nenga na Banabasi weka hela yitudayiliwa kugola chichuku ili tupati fitudayila mungalilu yetu? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wuli, ngandawu yoti yahombilili undumindumi waki kuungandawu? Mlimi liki yangajila kulya fivelekwa fya muchitava chaki cha misabibu? Mdima liki yangajila kulanda majiva va vasenga vaki?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wuli, ngudeta filongu afi chiwundu hela? Wuli Malawu va Musa veni vakudeta wuwu ng'odu? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yiyandikiwa mumalawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa, “Ukotoo kumuwopa mlomu senga patuta mupunga.” Wuli, tukuwesha kudeta Chapanga akukimbanikila vasenga? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wuli, aveli akutwihola yufwi ng'odu padetili nawula? Yina, afi fyayandikiwili kwanongwa ya yufwi, nongwa yula yalima na yula yabena, kila mundu akushuvilila kupata fivelekwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Payiva yufwi tukweta mbeyu ya chindima gati ya yumwi, wuli, chilongu chikomi kwa yumwi kupata fitudayila majuva vosi? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Payiva vamu vana jumu ya kwidumba afi kwa yumwi, wuli, yufwi tuvahela jumu nendu kwa veni?</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini, yufwi twigolela ha chindu jumu yila. Pambeli twiwunishila findu fyosi ili tukotoo kuchivikila ngingamu Chilongu cha Nyanyi cha Yesu Kilistu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wuli nakaka mumanya ng'odu kucha yivakimbanika nyumba ya Chapanga vakupata filivi mumula mula na vala yivatawulila litambiku mufyalu vakupata ng'odu mwambu wumu wa lila litambiku? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wuwula wula Bambu alayishili naha, vala yivavalandulila vandu Chilongu cha Nyanyi vapati filivi fyawu Muchilongu cha Nyanyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini, nenga ndola ng'odu hata yimu gati ya asi. Nguyandika ha afi ili mbati haki ayi, kwa nenga ngiba ndifwi pitu kumleka mundu ayiholi kucha ngwijuma hela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pandiva ngulandula Chilongu cha Nyanyi, achi chilongu cha kwidumbila ha, achi ndi chichuku chigayiliwili. Pishu nenga leki ngulandula ng'odu Chilongu cha Nyanyi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Leki ndingavelili ngugola chichuku achi kwa kudayila ndimweni, topi, ningashuvililili kuhombiwa, lakini leki ngugola chichuku achi ngajila ndimweni kudayila nahawu yikulangusha Chapanga kanyimba chichuku achi ndichigoli. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ponopa ijala yangu chindu liki? Topi ijala yangu ndi kuvalandulila vandu chilongu cha Nyanyi nguvalandulila hela wuwu ngajila ijala, nguhigha ha hombu sha chichuku cha kuchilandula Chilongu cha Nyanyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwanongwa ayi, nenga ndiva mvanda wa mundu yoyonda ha, ndiyigola mvanda wa kila mundu ili ndimukungili Kilistu vandu vatangalili. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwa Vayawudi ndayikalili ngimu Muyawudi ili ndivapati Vayawudi. Kwa vala yivawopiwa na Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa ndayikalili kucha ng'opiwa na Malawu ili ndivapati vala yivawopiwili na Malawu. Hata leki ndimweni nguwopiwa ha na Malawu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwa vala yivawopiwili ng'odu na Malawu, ndayikalili ngimu veni, panji ya Malawu, ili ndivapati yivavelili panji ya Malawu, nenga ha kucha ndiva panji ya Malawu va Chapanga, nongwa ngamuliwa na Malawu va Kilistu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwa vala yivavelili na ujumilwa mdokwa ndayikalili ngimu muna ujumilwa mdokwa ili ndivapati yivavelili na ujumilwa mdokwa. Ndiyigola kila chindu kwa vandu vosi ili ndivalowoli vamu wa vala kwa deha yoyonda yila. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ngugola fyosi afi kwanongwa ya Chilongu cha Nyanyi, ili mbati sangi shaki. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wuli, mumanya ng'odu kucha muluvagha lwa mbilu, ingava vandu vonda vakwivilinga, lakini yumu hela yavalongolela vayaki ndi yayitolela fupu? Wivilingi ili upati fupu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kila mundu yadayila kuvalongola vayaki akudayiliwa kufileka fyosi, akugola naha ili ayipatili likokoma liyanangika! Lakini yufwi tukugola nahawu ili tupati fupu yingajila kuyanangika. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ponopa nahawu ndi wundiyivilinga kunu pandiyilata kuwesha, nguleva ng'odu kucha mundu yaleva na liyegha. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nguugobola mvili wangu na ndiudindashi, ngugola naha ili pamalila ngotoo kuwoneka ngujakwa ha kuvalandulila vandu vamonga.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ngayikilu ya kutambikila ming'omung'omu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Valongu ngudayila mumanyi kucha vambuyi vetu yivamkovikelili Musa, vosi vajabukili vanofu mubahali dwifu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mulifundi lila na mubahali vosi vaveli kucha vabatishiwa vavi vanachuli va Musa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vosi valya filivi fifilafila fya ndima. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wuwula wula valanda chilandi chichila chila cha chindima. Nongwa valandili kufuma lila ligonguveli lya chindima livavakovikelili, ligonguveli lyeni ndi Kilistu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lakini vatangalili vamunowesha ng'odu Chapanga na fikongu fyawu vafitandalika kucheja.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ponopa milandu yosi yiwoneka kutuwula yufwi, yikutukayika yufwi tukotoo kudobukela wafu ngimu veni wuvadobukela. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mukotoo kuva vatundamila va ming'omung'omu ngimu vamu wuvagolili, ngimu mayandiku Vang'alili wuvadeta, “Vandu vayikalili pasi na valya na kulanda na kufina kwa ndambu ya wafu.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tukotoo kugola uwoni kucha vamu wuvagolili uwoni, lijuva limu hela vandu elufu milongu mivili na ndatu vasovili. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tukotoo kumuyesha Bambu Kilistu kucha vandu vamu wuvamuyeshili, vosi vasovili kwa kulumiwa na njoka. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mukotoo kung'ong'oleka kucha vamu wuvamung'ong'utekili, vawulayiwa na makungu wa njifwa!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Topi, afi fyosi fivafumbukila veni ili kutuwula yufwi kandi fiyandikiwa, ili kutukayika yufwi yituvelili mungalilu ya majuva va mwishu wa mlima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yayihola kucha kawoloka uswanu, ayivavali akotoo kuva. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuyeshiwa kumuyeshiwa kuhenja ha kwa mundu. Lakini Chapanga mweni avagayilili jangi yaki davaleki ng'odu, muyeshiwi pitu. Lakini pamuyeshiwa, mweni davapi liwovi lya kuyiwunishila na deha ya kufumila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na valongu vangu, muyilyepi kutundamila ming'omung'omu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nguywanga na yumwi kucha vandu yimuveli na luhunja. Muyihighi mwaveni achi chinywanga. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Patulunemela lwindi lwa Bambu, wuli, tukwilumba na mwasi wa Kilistu ng'odu? Na patumetula libumunda, wuli, tukwilumba ng'odu na mvili wa Kilistu? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwanongwa libumunda lyeni ndi limu, hata leki yufwi tutangala, tuva mvili wumu, nongwa vosi tukuvaghana libumunda limu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Muloli kwa chilangushilu cha Vayisilaeli, vala yivalya litambiku vakwilumba na Chapanga kupitila afi fyalu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Deti liki? Kucha filivi fitambikiliwi na ming'omung'omu ndi chindu chikomi pitu filivi? Na ayi ming'omung'omu ndi findu fikomi? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hata padokwa! Chideta ndi achi mitambiku yivatawula vandu vangajila kumumanya Chapanga vakuvatawulila vafinyamkela, Chapanga ha. Hata padokwa ngudayila ha yumwi muyilumbi na chinyamkela. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Damuweshi ng'odu kulandila lwindi lwa Bambu kunu mukulandila lwindi lwa chinyamkela. Damuweshi ha kulila mesa ya Bambu na mesa ya chinyamkela. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wuli, awu tukudayila kumugola Bambu ghavi na weyi? Mukwihola kucha tuva na liwovi pitu mweni?</para>
  <para style="s">Mugoli fyosi kwa ukomi wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Findu fyosi fikujumishiwa, lakini fyonda ha yifitanga. Findu fyonda halali lakini fyonda ha fya nyanyi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mundu yoyonda akotoo kwilola mweni, ila avaloli na vayaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mulyi kila chindu chimuhemesha ngajila kudasha dasha ili natilu shenu sikotoo kuva na hoshu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nongwa mayandiku vakudeta, “Mlima na fyosi yifivelili mumlima fya Bambu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Leki mundu yangajila kumujuma Chapanga pavalalika na yumwi pamuyenda, topi, muliyi fyosi fyavatandili ngajila kudasha dasha kwanongwa ya natilu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lakini mundu pavawombela, “Filivi afi fitambikiliwa ming'omung'omu,” Topi, kwanongwa ayu yavawombilili naha na kwanongwa ya natilu, mukotoo kulya. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ngudeta, “Kwanongwa ya natilu,” Natilu shenu ha, wala natilu ya yula yavawombilili.</para>
  <para style="p">“Finofu, pambeli,” mundu wingi kadasha, “wuli upekesu wangu uhighiwi natilu ya mundu wingi? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Leki payiva nenga ngulya filivi afi kunu ngumulumba Chapanga, nongwa liki mundu wingi ang'ombing'ombi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Topi, chochosi chimugola yivi kulya awu kulanda, mugoli fyosi kwanongwa ya ukomi wa Chapanga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mukotoo kuva ngingamu kwa Vayawudi awu kwa Vagiliki awu kwa lipinga lya vandu yivamjumila Kilistu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Muvi ngimu nenga, nguyesha kuvanowesha vosi kwa deha yoyonda, ngajila kusaka fwayida yangu ndimweni ila kwa fwayida ya vosi, ili valowuliwi.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mungovikeli nenga kucha nenga wundimukovikela Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwigubika mutwi mukudadava</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nguvajuma kwa kungumbuka kunu pamukamulila vala Malawu vendivagayilili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lakini ngudayila mumanyi kucha Kilistu ndi mutwi wa kila mlumi na mlumi mutwi wa mdalamundu na Chapanga mutwi wa Kilistu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Topi, kila mlumi yadadava awu yula yalandula unjagila kufuma kwa Chapanga kunu kagubika mutwi waki, ayu akumgayila soni Kilistu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Na Mdadala padadava awu palandula chilongu cha Chapanga ngajila kugubika mutwi waki, akubedala mutwi waki, mdala yagola naha akulinganila na mdala yamoghili fwili shaki. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mdala yangajila kugubika mutwi waki, ngiba adumuli fwili shaki. Lakini dayivi chindipa kwa mdadala kumogha fwili shaki awu kumoghiwa fwili shaki, ngiba agubiki mutwi waki. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nyanyi ha kwa mlumi kugubika mutwi waki nongwa mweni akwifwana na Chapanga na ndi ukomi wa Chapanga, lakini mdadala ndi ukomi wa mlumi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mlumi Kafuma kwa mdadala ha, lakini mdadala kafuma kwa mlumi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mlumi kalumbiwa kwanongwa ya mdadala ha, ila mdadala kalumbiwa kwanongwa ya mlumi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwanongwa ya Makungu mdadala akugubika mutwi waki, ili yivi chilangushilu cha uwesu wuveli pambindi yaki. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwa kwilumba na Bambu, mdadala chindu ha pangajila mlumi na mlumi chindu ha pangajila mdadala. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngimu wuyivelili mdadala afumili kwa mlumi, wuwula wula mlumi kaleliwa na mdadala lakini fyosi fikufuma kwa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mulamuli mwaveni nahawu finofu kwa mdadala kudadava kwa Chapanga ngajila kwigubika chindu kumutwi? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hata ndambu ya fisingu fyeni fikulangusha kucha kwa mlumi kuva na fwili ndali chindipa kwa mweni. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini kwa mdadala kuva na fwili ndali ndi chindu cha kwidumbila kwa mweni, kagayiliwa fwili ndali ili simugubiki. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Leki mundu akudayila kuyegha malimbu muchilongu achi, topi amanyi kucha yufwi tuvahela chishovi chingi, wala lipinga lya vandu yivamjumila Kilistu vavahela chishovi chingi.</para>
  <para style="s">Filivi fya ngumbungumbu ya njifwa ya Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:29, Maliku 14:22-25, Lukasi 22:14-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mumalawu vandivapa nguvajuma ha, ngweshi ng'odu hata padokwa mumalawu ava vandivagayila nguvajuma ng'odu, mungungashu shenu sha kumjuma Chapanga mukugola wafu wutangalili nendu ya usangi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Cha kwaa mbikanila pamwikungasha pamu kucha lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu yikubwituka shoshu gati ya yumwi. Na nenga padokwa ngujumila. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nongwa nakaka damwipoti gati ya yumwi ili vala yivaveli va Chapanga vamanyiki. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nakaka pamwikungasha, mukwihola mukulya filivi fya Bambu kumbi ha! <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nongwa pamulya kila mundu akulya filivi ngajila kuvaveta vayenu, mbaka vamu vakuva na njala kunu vamonga vakulovela! <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wuli, muva hela kaya sha kulya na kulandila? Awu mukulibedala lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu na mukuvataya soni vala vangajila chindu? Ponopa ng'ombi liki? Ndivajumi!? Ng'odu! Kwa chindu achi ndivajumi ng'odu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kwanongwa nenga ndayangili kwa Bambu vala yindivagayila yumwi, Bambu Yesu lumihi lula pashengitiwili atolili libumunda, <verse number="24" style="v"/>kamulumba Chapanga, kalimetula, kunu padeta, “Ayi ndi njimba yangu mugayililwi yumwi mugoli naha kwa ngumbungumbu ya nenga.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Wuwula wula, palili kala katola lwindi kadeta, “Alu ndi lwindi lwa lilaghanu lya shonu lwa mwasi wangu. Mugoli naha, kila pamulanda pamungumbuka nenga.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nongwa kila pamulya libumunda ali na kulandila lwindi alu, mukulandula njifwa ya Bambu mbaka payisa kandi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Topi, kila yaghalya libumunda ali, awu kulandila lwindi alu lwa Bambu ngajila kudayiliwa, akuva na mbatiwa ya kuuvifya mvili na mwasi wa Bambu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Topi, kila mundu ayilembeshi mweni tanila, pambeli ghalyi libumunda ali na kulandila lwindi alu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nongwa yaghalya na kulanda ngajila kumanya mvili wa Bambu ndi chindu liki, akulya na kulanda highilu yaki mweni. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ndi nongwa gati yenu kuna vasosuvafu na vatami na vamonga vasova kala. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Leki tungayilembishili twaveni finofu tungahighiwili ng'odu na Chapanga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini patuhighiwa na Bambu, tukufundiwa tuvi na luhala, ili tukotoo kuva na mbatiwa pamu na vandu va mlima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ponopa valongu vangu, pamuva pamu mukulya ndilya ya Bambu, mwiveti. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nongwa leki kuna mundu yavelili na njala, ghalyi kayaki, ili ndanganilu yenu yikotoo kuyegha highilu ya Chapanga. Lakini kwa yila milandu yingi, dandivawuli panyisa.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fupu sha Mfuki Mng'alili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Valongu, ponopa ngudayila mumanyi finofu milandu ya fupu sha Mfuki Mng'alili. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngumanya kucha, pamuveli vangajila kumumanya Chapanga, mwavelili mulongushiwa mudeha sha wafu kuyitundamila ming'omung'omu yingajila unofu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ngudayila mumanyi naha, kwahela mundu yoyosi yalongoshiwa na Mfuki wa Chapanga daweshi kudeta, “Yesu alapiliwi!” Wuwula wula, kwahela mundu yoyosi yaweshi kudeta, “Yesu ndi Bambu,” paalongushiwa ng'odu na Mfuki Mng'alili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Fupu sha chindima siva sha ndambu sitangalili, lakini Mfuki yasitawula ndi yumu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuna ndambu kafwauti kafwauti sha kukimbanika lakini Bambu yakimbanikiwa ndi yumu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kandi kuna ndambu sitangalili sha kugola chichuku, lakini Chapanga ndi yavagayila uwesu vandu, wa kugola chichuku shosi kwa vandu vosi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kwa kila mundu Mfuki Mng'alili akwilangusha kwa ndambu yiwutunga kwa fwayida ya vandu vonda. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mfuki akumgayila mundu yumu lulayilayi lwa luhunja na Mfuki yuyoyu akumgayila mundu wingi lulayilayi lwa umanyi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mfuki yuyoyu akumgayila mundu wingi ujumilwa na wingi akumgayila fupu ya kulowola vandu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mfuki Mng'alili akumgayila mundu wingi fupu ya kugola mihilu na wingi fupu ya kudeta umbuyi wa Chapanga na wingi akumgayila uwesu wa kumanya fupu sha Mfuki Mng'alili na singajila kuva sha Mfuki Mng'alili na wingi fupu ya kudeta ng'ombelu henja na wingi fupu ya kumanya ng'ombelu singajila kumanyika. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Asi shosi ndi chichuku sha Mfuki Mng'alili, mweni akumupa kila mundu fupu, ngimu wadayila Mfuki Mng'alili.</para>
  <para style="s">Mvili wumu lakini fisingu fitangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngimu wula wuvelili mvili wumu wuna fisingu fitangalili na fisingu afi fyosi fikuwugola mvili wumu nahawu ndi wuyivelili kwa Kilistu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nongwa yufwi Vayawudi na Vagiliki, vavanda awu vandu yivavelili pekesu, vosi tubatishiwa kwa Mfuki Mng'alili ndi yumu na mumvili wumu, twavosi tukulanda kwa Mfuki yumu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nongwa mvili uwumbiwa kwa chisingu chimu hela ha, ila kwa fisingu fitangalili. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Leki liwulu lingayiwombilili, “Kwanongwa nenga liwoku ng'odu, topi, nenga wa mvili ha.” Wuli, liwulu liva lya mvili ng'odu? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Leki lijeji lingayidetilili, “Kwanongwa nenga lisu ng'odu, topi nenga wa mvili ha,” Wuli lijeji dalivi lya mvili ng'odu? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Leki mvili wosi wungaveli lisu, mundu angapikanilili wuliwuli? Mani mvili wosi wungaveli lijeji mundu angaweshili wuli kuyambula? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lakini Chapanga kavika fisingu fyosi chakachaka ha kwa kila mundu ngimu wadayilili. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Leki fisingu fyosi fingaveli chisingu chimu, mvili wungaveli koti! <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ngimu wuyiveli kuna fisingu fitangala, lakini mvili ndi wumu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Topi, lisu likuwesha ha kuliwombela liwoku, “Ngukudayila ha yuwi!” Na mutwi wuweshi ha kuvawombela mawulu, “Nguvadayila ng'odu yumwi!” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lakini nendu ya afi yikuwoneka kucha fisingu fila fya mvili yifiwoneka fisosovafu afi fya maha nendu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kandi fisingu fyitwihola kucha fivahela utundamilu mkomi, ndi yifituvika kwa uloleli mkomi munu, fisingu fya mvili yifiwoneka kucha finofu munu, tukufikola munu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lakini fisingu fimonga fikudayiliwa ha kugolikeshiwa. Chapanga mweni kauvika mvili ndambu ayi kachigayila utundamilu mkomi chisingu chingajila kutundamila. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Topi kukotoo kuva na kulekana mumvili ila fisingu fyosi fiyitangi telatela. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Leki chisingu chimu chikugobuleka fisingu fyosi fikugobuleka pamu na cheni. Chisingu chimu pachitundamiwa fyosi fikusekilela pamu na cheni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Topi, mwavosi yumwi muva mvili wa Kilistu, kila mundu ndi chisingu mumvili awu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Chapanga kavika mu lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu, yakwaa vandundami, pambeli vambuyi, kandi vawula, pambeli kavavika vala vana kugola mihilu, kunanisha na kutanga, filongosi na yivadeta ng'ombelu henja. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wuli, vosi vandundami? Awu vosi vambuyi? Awu vosi vawula? Awu vosi vava na uhwadali wa kugola mihilu? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vosi ha yivavelili na uwesu wa kulowola awu kuwomba ng'ombelu henja awu kumanya ng'ombelu henja <verse number="31" style="v"/>Muvi na dobukelu ya kupata fupu nofu nendu.</para>
  <para style="p">Ponopa nenga dandivalangushi deha nofu nendu pitu asi.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Udayilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hata leki padeta detelu sha vandu na hata sha vanjagila kufuma kwa Chapanga, lakini leki ndiva hela utami nenga ngwifwana kucha lishu lya lidebi hela awu chijofu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Leki ndina fupu ya kulandula na kumanya mbwepu shosi sifisikili na kumanya kila chindu, nguwesha kuva na ujumilwa wa kusewusha fidunda, lakini leki pandiva nahela utami nenga chindu ha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pandawula fimelili nafyu na kuvagayila vagaju, hata pandiyitawula njimba yangu wunyanyiwi motu, lakini ndivahela utami nenga ngupata chindu ha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mundu muna utami akwiwunishila, ukwiyikala, muna lusungu kavahela weyi, ukwijuma ha wala kwidumba ng'odu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Muna utami ukumpota utundamilu ha, akusaka fwayida yaki weka hela ha, wala mpusu wa maya va kalopu kalopu ha, akwimwivalangila mundu wafu ha, <verse number="6" style="v"/>akusekilela ha wafu, ila ukusekilela unakaka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mundu muna utami akujumila fyosi, akwiwunishila fyosi akushuvilila ngajila kutofya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Utami wuvahela mbaka, leki kuna umbuyi dawupeli, leki fupu ya kudeta detelu henja, dayipeli, leki kuna luhala na lweni dalupeli. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nongwa fupu yetu ya umanyi yikwila ha na fupu yetu ya umbuyi yikwila ha, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Chipindi Chapanga pagola kala findu fyosi fikwili, fingajila kukwila dafiwuki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pandiveyi mwana chali ndadetili chiwana chali, ndamanyili chichali, ndayiholili chichali. Pameli mkomi ndifileka fyosi fya vana chali. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Chituchiwona ponopa chikwila ha yiva kucha wushu wutuwuwona mulindala, lakini pambeli datuloli wushu kwa wushu. Ponopa ndifimanya padokwa hela, lakini pambeli damanyi fyosi nakamu, ngimu wula Chapanga wamanya nenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hata naha ponopa tuva na findu afi fitatu dafivi majuva vosi, ujumilwa na shuvililu na utami, lakini chivelili chikomi kwa fyosi ndi utami.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Findu fimonga fya Mfuki Mng'alili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mwikangashi kuva na utami. Wuwula wula mukuvilishi kupata fupu singi sha Mfuki Mng'alili, chamunu fupu ya kulandula lulayilayi lwa Chapanga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yadeta ng'ombelu henja akudeta na vandu ha akudeta na Chapanga nongwa kwahela mundu yampikana. Akudeta kwa liwovi lya Mfuki findu fifisikili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lakini yula yadeta ng'ombelu henja na vandu na kuvatanga kuvadindasha chindima, kuvakuvilisha na kuvakola mawoku. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Munakudeta ng'ombelu henja akwidindasha mweni. Lakini yula yalandula unjagila wa Chapanga, akulidindasha lipinga lya vandu yivamjumila Kilistu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Topi ngadayilili mwavosi yumwi mudeti kwa ng'ombelu henja lakini ngadayilili munu muvi na fupu ya kulandula unjagila wa Chapanga. Kwanongwa yula yalandula ndi mkomi kwa yula yadeta ng'ombelu henja, leki paveli mundu yamanyili kuvawombela vandu fila fyadetili ili lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu liweshi kutangiwa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ponopawu valongu vangu, panyisa kwa yumwi na kudeta na yumwi kwa ng'ombelu henja dayivatangi liki? Dayivatangi chindu ha, ila leki pandivawombela unjagila wa Chapanga awu umanyi wuutunga awu kutunga awu kuwula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hata findu fingajila unofu yififumisha lishu kucha miluli awu lugombugombu. Leki pafifumisha ng'odu lishu ali awu lila mundu akuwesha wuli kumanya msambu liki wukuviwa? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Leki limbalapi payifumisha ng'odu lishu lyaki finofu ghani daghavi kayitanda kala kwa mgoha? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wuwula wula na yumwi, leki chimudeta chikumanyika ng'odu, ghani daweshi kumanya chimudeta? Topi mukuva kucha vandu yimudeta na liyegha. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pasiveli detelu sitangalili mumlima shosi sikumanyika. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Leki manya ng'odu chadeta mundu wingi, nenga ndiva muhenja kwa mweni na mweni muhenja kwa nenga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wuwula wula na yumwi yikubayulila kupata fupu sha Mfuki, mukimbaniki munu kupapata sila sitanga kulidindasha lipinga lya vandu yivamjumila Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ponopa munakudeta ng'ombelu henja dadavi kwa Chapanga akupi uwesu wa kumanya. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nongwa padadava kwa detelu henja ndima yangu yikudadava nendu, lakini luhala lwangu lukupata chindu ha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi, goli wuli? Dadadavi kwa ndima yangu wuwula wula dadadavi kwa luhala lwangu dasomoli mundima yangu lakini wuwula wula dasomoli kwa luhala lwangu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pandimjuma Chapanga kwa ndima yaku hela, leki kuna mundu kamanya ng'odu chiwudeta daweshi wuli wuli kuyitikila, “Yina, pamlumba Chapanga leki kamanya ng'odu chiwudeta? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Dadawu yaku ya kumulumba Chapanga yikuwesha nakaka kuva nofu lakini yula wingi dayimtangi chindu ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ngumulumba Chapanga kucha nenga nguwomba detelu henja pitu mwavosi yumwi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini mungushu ya lipinga lya vandu yivamjumila Kilistu ngudayila kudeta filongu muhanu fimanyikili, ili ndivawuli vandu vatangalili pitu kuwomba filongu fitangalili kwa ng'ombelu henja.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Valongu mukotoo kuva kucha vananguta muhoshu shenu. Muvi kucha vana fyali mumilandu ya wafu, lakini pamuyihola muvi kucha vandu vakomi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Malawu vakudeta naha,</para>
  <para style="q">“Kwa njila ya vala yivawomba ng'ombelu henja,</para>
  <para style="q">dang'ombi na vandu ava,</para>
  <para style="q">na kwa mumilomu ya vahenja, yivaveli na kabila henja</para>
  <para style="q">hata naha davambikani ha akuwomba Bambu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Topi, fupu ya ng'ombelu henja ndi chilangushilu kwa vandu vangajila ujumilwa, lakini kwa vala yivajumila ha, ila fupu ya kutunga yiva kwa vala yivajumila kwa vala vangajila kujumila ha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Topi, lipinga lya vandu yivamjumila Kilistu lyosi paliyikungasha pamu na kila mundu padeta detelu henja, leki pavayisa vandu vangajila kumanya awu yangajila kujumila, davawombi nda kucha yumwi muna lukwali? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lakini vosi pavatunga payisa mundu hela awu vangajila kujumila, fyosi fyapikana dafivalangushi wafu wa veni na dafivahighi kwa fila fivapikanili. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hoshu shawu siyifisili dasifisuliwi na mweni datundami padadava kwa Chapanga pawomba, “Nakaka Chapanga kava pamu na yumwi”</para>
  <para style="s">Ulongoshi mulipinga lya yivamjumila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Valongu vangu topi tudeti liki? Pamuyikungasha pamu mukudadava Chapanga yumu asomoli, yumu awuli, yumu ghavi na ugubutulu wa Chapanga, wingi ghavi na fupu ya kuwomba ng'ombelu henja na wingi avawombeli vandu vamonga chila chivawombili. Fyosi figoleki ili kuvatanga vandu va Chapanga. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pakava mundu yavelili na fupu ya kudeta detelu henja, vavili awu vatatu lakini adeti mundu yumu yumu, ila kuvi na mundu wa kuvawombela vandu vamonga fivadetili. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lakini leki kwahela mundu yawesha kuvawombela vandu chila chivadetili, topi, yula yawomba ng'ombelu henja anyamali pala palikungashu, awombi kunda ya hela na Chapanga. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vala yilandula unjagila wa Chapanga vavili awu vatatu vawombi kunu vandu vamonga valembeshi chila chivadetili. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini leki mundu yumu mulikungashu kayanga unjagila wa Chapanga, topi na yula yawomba anyamali. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nongwa mwavosi mukuwesha kulandula unjagila wagayiliwili na Chapanga, yumu yumu ili kila mundu ayiwuli na adindashiwi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Fupu ya kulandula unjagila wa Chapanga utavaliwi na yula yalandula umbuyi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nongwa Chapanga kava wa ndilingu ha, ila mweni ndi Chapanga wa kusika.</para>
  <para style="p">Kucha wuyivelili mu lipinga lya vandu yivamjumila Kilistu, <verse number="34" style="v"/>vadala vanyamali jii mulikungashu. Vakudayiliwa ng'odu kuwomba wala kulongosha kucha Malawu va Vayawudi wuvawomba. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Leki pavava na minasha ya kunasha, vavanashi valumi vawu kaya, nongwa yiva chindipa kwa mdala kudeta mulikungashu lya vandu yivamjumila Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wuli, mukwihola Chilongu cha Chapanga chifuma kwa yumwi? Awu mukwihola chivayisila yumwi weka hela? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Leki mundu yoyosi yayihola kucha mweni kana fupu ya kudeta unjagila wa Chapanga awu kucha kavanayu fupu ya Mfuki Mng'ali, amanyi kucha afi findivayandikila yumwi ndi Malawu va Bambu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Leki mundu yangajila kupikana afi na mweni akotoo kupikanishiwa. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Topi, valongu vangu, mukudayiliwa kuva na bayililu ya kulandula unjagila wa Chapanga mukotoo kumukanisha mundu kuwomba ng'ombelu henja. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lakini fyosi figoleki kwa ugoleki na unofu.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kushukuka kwa Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Topi valongu ngudayila kuvamanyisha Chilongu cha Nyanyi chindivalandulili na yumwi mwachiyangili na mwawolukili uswanu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Achi ndi chilongu cha Nyanyi, chilongu chindivalandulilili yumwi. Yumwi mulowuliwa kwa Chilongu cha Nyanyi mani pamuchikamula nakaka pamongapa kujumila kwa yumwi kungaveli kuvahela mana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nenga ndavagayilili yumwi chila ndichiyangili ndimweni, kucha Kilistu asovili kwanongwa ya sambi shetu ngimu Mayandiku Vang'alili wuvadeta, <verse number="4" style="v"/>asikilwi, ashukukili mnofu lijuva lya tatu ngimu yivayandikili mumayandiku mang'alili wuvadeta, <verse number="5" style="v"/>pambeli amfumbukilili Kefa na pambeli avafumbukilili vandundami vosi lilongu na vavili. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pambeli avafumbukilili vandu mya muhanu kwa mwanja wumu, vamonga mbaka nalelu vakali vanofu, lakini vamu vasova kala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pambeli amfumbukilili Yakobi, pambeli kavafumbukila vandundami vonda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kumbelu afumbukilili nenga, nenga ndawonikili kucha mwana njiti. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nongwa nenga ndi mdokwa nakamu kwa vandundami vosi, ngujakwa ha kukemiwa ndundami, kwanongwa ndaligobulili lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lakini kwa usangi wa Chapanga ndiva ngimu wumeli, usangi yangayilili, yaveli ya hela ha. Nenga gola chichuku ngomi pitu vandundami vosi, kwa liwovi lya ndimweni hela ha, ila kupitila usangi wa Chapanga yigola chichuku pamu nayu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hata leki naha mani, yivi veni yivalandulili awu nenga yinandula, chindu ha achi ndi chitulandulili na achi ndi chimuchijumila.</para>
  <para style="s">Ushukushu wetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Leki yilandulilwi kucha Kilistu ashukukili, wuli vamonga gati ya yumwi vakuwesha kudeta kwahela ushukushu? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Leki kwahela ushukushu kwa vandu yivasovili, topi na Kilistu kashukuka ng'odu, <verse number="14" style="v"/>na leki Kilistu kashukuka ng'odu, topi fyosi fitulandula fyahela mana na ujumilwa wenu wuvahela mana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Chikomi kupita fyonda yufwi tungaveli vatovilela va udesi kwa Chapanga, nongwa twawombili kucha Chapanga amshukushili Kilistu kumbi mweni kamushukusha ha, leki nakaka yivasovili vakushukushiwa ng'odu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nongwa, payiva leki nakaka kucha yivasovili vakushukuka ng'odu, topi na mweni Kilistu kashukuka ha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na leki Kilistu kashukushiwa ng'odu, topi, jumilu yenu yivahela chindu, mukali musighala mu sambi shenu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Na dayimanyiki kucha, vala yivasovili kunu pava vamjumilili Kilistu vayaghamila nakamu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Leki shuvililu yetu ndi Kilistu muunofu awu hela, yufwi tukudayiliwa kuwonelwa lusungu pitu vandu vosi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini unakaka weni ndi awu Kilistu ashukukili, mweni wa kwaa kwa vandu yivasovili. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mana ngimu njifwa wuyiyeghiwili na mundu yumu, wuwula wula kushukuka kuyeghiwa na mundu yumu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwa kwilumba na Adamu vandu vosi vasovili, wuwula wula vosi davavi vanofu kwa kwilumba na Kilistu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lakini kila mundu kwa ndambu yaki, yakwaa Kilistu, pambeli vala vosi yivaveli va mweni pawuya Kilistu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mwishu dawufiki damuhadishi Tati Chapanga wutwa, damalili kuyananga wutwa na ukomi na wovi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nongwa Kilistu akudayiliwa atavali mbaka Chapanga davaviki vachimdwama vaki pasi ya mawulu vaki. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Chimdwama wa kumbeli kuwulaghiwa daghavi njifwa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nongwa mayandiku vakudeta, “Chapanga kafivika findu fyosi pasi ya mawulu vaki.” Lakini, Mayandiku pavadeta, “Findu fyosi fivikwa pasi ya mawulu vaki” Nakaka kucha kwahela Chapanga mufindu afi, nongwa mweni ndi yafivikili findu afi pasi ya mawulu va Kilistu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lakini pafivika findu fyosi pasi ya mawulu va Kilistu, pambeli Mwana daayiviki pasi ya Chapanga, ili Chapanga atavali findu fyonda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Leki kwahela ushukushu, davagoli wuliwuli vandu vala yivabatishiwili kwanongwa ya yivasovili? Leki yivasovili vakushukushiwa ng'odu nongwa liki vakubatishiwa kwanongwa ya veni? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na yufwi, nongwa liki twikwivika muhatali ya njifwa kila saa?. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Valongu vangu, kila lijuva nguva munjifwa! Ngwidumbila yumwi kwa kwilumba na Yesu Kilistu Bambu wetu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Leki ngavelili ngwiminya na vang'ongolu vakali aku Ifesu kwa milandu ya chiwundu ndambatili liki? Lakini vasovili vakushukuka ng'odu. Leki “Tulyi na tulandi nongwa chilawu datusovi”.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mukotoo kwijanga, “Lighanja lya wafu likuyananga ngalilu nofu.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Muyimuki, muwuyi kungalilu nofu muleki ngalilu ya sambi, kwanongwa vandu vamu vamumanya ng'odu Chapanga. Ngudeta naha ili kuvataya soni.</para>
  <para style="s">Njimba singajila kuwola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mundu akuwesha kudasha, “Wuli yivasovili vakushukushiwa wuliwuli? Davavi na mvili wa ndambu liki?” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yuwi mpufi! Mbeyu yiwukweta yikumela ha mbaka yifwi tanila. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pawukweta, ukukweta libeleghi ha ila ukukweta mbeyu hela, yivi mbeyu ya upemba awu mbeyu yingi. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lakini Chapanga akwigayila mibeleghi ngimu wadayila na kila mbeyu akuyipa ndambu yaki weni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Njimba sha filumbi fikulinganila ha, Vandu vana njimba shawu na vang'ongolu vana njimba shawu na vambongu vana njimba shawu na vasomba vana njimba shawu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Njimba sivelili kumbindi kwa Chapanga yikwifwana ha na njimba sha pamlima. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lijuva lina unofu waki na mwesi wuna unofu waki na ndondwa sina unofu waki na hata ndondwa na sheni sikwifwana ha kwa unofu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Naha ndi dayivi pavashukuka yivasovili. Njimba yikusikiwa pawuva wudanganyika, pawushukuka ukuva wungajila kudanganyika. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Wukusikiwa kwa chindipa wukushukuka kwa ukomi wukusikiwa kwa usosuvafu na wukushukuka pawuva na liwovi. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Wukusikiwa mvili wa chiwundu na wukushukuka mvili wa Chindima. Leki kuna mvili wa chiwundu wuwula wula kuna mvili wa Chindima. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nongwa mayandiku vakuwomba, “Mundu wa kwaa Adamu kava chilumbi mnofu” Lakini Adamu wakumbeli ndi Mfuki Mng'alili yavagayila vandu unofu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Wukandili kwisa mvili wa chindima ha, ila wukandili mvili wa chiwundu pambeli mvili wa chindima. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mundu wa kwaa alumbiwili kwa uganga, mundu wa pili afumili kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yula yalumbiwili kwa unganga akwifwana na vala va pamlima na yula yafumili kumbindi kwa Chapanga akwifwana na vala va kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ngimu kuyifwana na yula yagoliliwili kwa uganga, wuwula wula datwifwani na yula yafumili kumbindi kwa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Valongu vangu chidayila kudeta ndi achi, mvili na mwasi dafiweshi ha kuhala wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Fila fiyanangika dafiweshi ha kuhala unofu wa jola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Mupikani ndivawombeli lupwepu, yufwi twavosi datusovi ha, ila datughalambuliwi, <verse number="52" style="v"/>chipindi limbalapi lya mwishu palilanduliwa, teputepu vandu yivasovili davashukushiwi kunu njimba shawu dasivi singajila kuyanangika na yufwi datughalambuliwi. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Nongwa chila yichiwola chiyifwalili ndambu ya ngajila kuwola na mvili wusovili wunghalambuki wukotoo kusova. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Topi mvili awu wuyanangika pauyifwalila ndambu yingajila kughalambuka wukotoo kuyanangika na chila chisova pachighalambuka chikotoo kusova, davavi vala Mayandiku Mang'alili yivadeta, “Njifwa yiyaghamishiwa na uweshi wuva!”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>“Yuwi njifwa uweshi waku wuva koti?</para>
  <para style="q">Yuwi njifwa lihingili lyaku liva koti?”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Lihingili lya njifwa ndi sambi na liwovi lya sambi ndi Malawu. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Lakini tumuhongeshi Chapanga yatugayila uweshi kupitila Bambu wetu Yesu Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Topi, valongu vangu yindivatamili, muwoloki ndemindemi pangajila kutikanyika. Majuva vosi muyendileli kugola chichuku cha Bambu, kwanongwa mumanya chichuku yimugola mugati ya Bambu dayiyaghamili hela ha.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuvapa vandu va Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ponopa deti milandu ya kuvapa vandu va Chapanga, mugoli ngimu wundivawombilili vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu wa aku Galatiya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kila lijuva lya kupumulila kila mundu abavi na aviki mbiya ngimu wapatili, ili panyisa mukotoo kuyimba kandi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pambeli panyisa kwa yumwi, dandivalayishi vala yimudayila kuvashawula vayeghi baluwa na ndawulilu yenu aku Yelusalemu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Leki payiva nyanyi nenga kuyenga aku, datuyendi pamu.</para>
  <para style="s">Hoshu sha Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pandiva nguyenda Makedoniya, danyisi tanila kwa yumwi kwanongwa ngudayila kuyenda Makedoniya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nguwesha dandiyikali chipindi chidokwa na yumwi, pamongapa dandiyikali chipindi chosi cha mkakamu, ili muweshi kundanga kuyendelela mumwanja wangu kunyenda. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Dayila ha kupitila kwa yumwi kalopu kalopu na kuyendilela na mwanja wangu. ngushuvilila kwikala na yumwi chipindi chitali padokwa, Bambu pandanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini dandiyikali apa Ifesu mbaka lijuva lya Pendikosti. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwanongwa mulyangu wuva lipala kwa nenga kugola chichuku yitawukili apa, hata leki kuvaveli yivanimba nenga vatangala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Timotewu payisa kwa yumwi, mukotoo kumugola ghavi na chipwembwi chochosi chipindi paghava na yumwi, kwanongwa mweni akugola chichuku cha Bambu, ngimu nenga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Topi mundu yoyonda akotoo kumubedala, ila mumtangi ayendeleli na mwanja kwa kusika aweshi kuwuya kwa nenga, nongwa ngushuvilila awuyi na vandu vatangalili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Milandu ya Apolu, ndimukuvilisha ayisi kwa yumwi pamu na volongu vengi, ila akudayila ha kwisa ponopa ila dayisi papata fwasi.</para>
  <para style="s">Chilongu cha mwishu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mugungi mesu, muwoloki uswanu muujumilu, muvi vahwadali na yimuvelili na liwovi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kila chimugola mugoli kwa utami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Muvamanya Stefwani na valongu vaki, veni valongulili kuva va Kilistu aku Akaya, muvakala na vayitawula kuvakimbanikila vandu va Chapanga. Topi, valongu vangu nguvaluva, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Muvapikani vandu ngimu ava na kila mundu yagola chichuku na veni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ngusekilela kwisa kwa Stefwani na Fotunatusi pamu na Akayiku, veni vatola chiyangilili kwa yumwi yimuyangili. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vafwamusha ndima yangu na shenu wuwowu, kwanongwa ayi yikudayiliwa kuvakumbuka vandu va nahawu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mipinga ya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu va Asia vakuvajambusha, Akula na Piliska na vandu vosi yivayikungashili munyumba shawu vakuvajambusha kwa ndima ya kuyilumba na Bambu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Valongu vonda yivavelili apa vakuvajambusha na yumwi.</para>
  <para style="p">Mwijambushi mwaveni kwa mwaveni kulangusha utami wenu kwa Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nenga Pauli nguvajambusha, panyandika kwa liwoku lyangu ndimweni. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mundu yoyonda yangajila kumtama Bambu, alapiliwi! Bambu wetu, wisi!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Usangi wa Bambu Yesu wuvi na yumwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Utami wa nenga wuvi kwa yumwi yimwilumbili na Yesu Kilistu.</para>
</usx>
